   "text": "IU International University of Applied Sciences - QS Apply\nSkip to main content\nHOMEPAGE\nAPPLICATIONS\nNOTIFICATIONS\nEK\nIU International University of Applied Sciences\nSummary\nDegrees and Programs\nStudent Testimonials\nCommission\nViewer Access\nAny user can see this institution.\nDescription\nIU International University of Applied Sciences is a private, state-accredited university of applied sciences in Germany. IU have two campuses in Bad Honnef and Berlin. IU offers on-campus degree programs that have a strong international focus: all courses are taught in English, the curriculum is aligned to the future needs of international companies. Professors and students from over 85 nations meet and work together on–campus.\nTimestamps\nUpdated\n29/06/2026 09:07\nby Eston Dalmeida\nCreated\n26/03/2026 10:14\nby Gunia Beniwal\nType\nUniversity\nCountry\nGermany\nYearly Fees\nMax: €15,916.00\nMin: €11,933.00\nInternational Students\nPercentage of International Students\n40%\n16,000 of 40,000 Total Students\nOverview\nBasic Details\nInstitution Details\nOwnership\nPrivate\nProvider\nDirect QS\nFounded Year\n1998\nCampus(es)\nBad Honef, Berlin, Cologne\nCountry\nGermany\nExcluded Countries\nNA\nPREMIUM INSTITUTION\n No\nContract Start Date\n28/11/2024\nContract End Date\n01/01/2036\nContract Entity\nQSSA Ltd\nContract Status\nActive\nContract Document Link(s)\nN/A\nImages\nImages\nAdditional Details\nAccommodation Details\nAccommodation available\nScholarship Offered\nScholarship available\nYouTube Video Link(s)\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UfDJt0z1z9A\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0Du_ggZbz5A\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Ijwwme9EvaY\nInternship Details\n-\nAdditional Information\n-",
